{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program' data-target='computer\/program' data-title='Program'>\r\n\t\t\tProgram\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program\/mysql' data-target='computer\/program\/mysql' data-title='MySQL'>\r\n\t\t\tMySQL\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Remote access: 0.0.0.0, verify, /etc//mysql/my.cnf, bind-address =, and lsof -i -P | grep :3306.","label":"Remote access","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/mysql\/password","label":"Password","url":"\/computer\/program\/mysql\/password"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/program\/mysql\/replace","label":"Replace","url":"\/computer\/program\/mysql\/replace"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttp:\/\/www.cyberciti.biz\/faq\/unix-linux-mysqld-server-bind-to-more-than-one-ip-address\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tUbuntu.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tBind to ipaddress.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>\/etc\/\/mysql\/my.cnf<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>bind-address =<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tXxx.xxx.xxx.xxx.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>0.0.0.0<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAny.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRestart MySQL.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>verify<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>lsof -i -P | grep :3306<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>netstat -nlt | grep 3306<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>netstat -tulpn<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Create user (user@&lt;guest&gt;)<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tElse.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<strong>Error.<\/strong> User not allowed to.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCREATE USER 'username'@'localhost' IDENTIFIED BY 'password';.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tGRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON *.* TO 'username'@'localhost' WITH GRANT OPTION;.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCREATE USER 'username'@'%' IDENTIFIED BY 'password';.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tGRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON *.* TO 'username'@'%' WITH GRANT OPTION;.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tFLUSH PRIVILEGES;.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/mysql\/remote_access\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/mysql\/remote_access\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/mysql\/password' data-target='computer\/program\/mysql\/password' data-title='Password' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Password<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/program\/mysql\/replace' data-target='computer\/program\/mysql\/replace' data-title='Replace' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div clas